WEBVTT

NOTE Transcript of the narration

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.300
Brand Passport: from Vietnam to the world.

2
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:10.100
In the riverside town of Vàm
Thịnh, you take over Mộc Nhiên,

3
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.800
a herbal cosmetics brand with a
beautiful story and limited resources.

4
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.400
Your mission: take it
global in six quarters.

5
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:21.200
Read the signals, choose your
entry, handle what comes,

6
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.300
and decide through a fog of information.

7
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:27.100
Seven markets are waiting, each
modelled on a real country.

8
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.700
One is digital and crowded,
one demands strict standards,

9
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:33.900
another only trusts partners who stay.

10
00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:39.600
Choose how to enter: a digital
platform, licensing, direct export,

11
00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:44.400
an alliance, a joint venture, or full
ownership if you're capable enough.

12
00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.500
Success is measured five ways:

13
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:52.000
profit, reputation, capability,
adaptability and sustainability.

14
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.300
Every decision leaves a footprint.

15
00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:00.100
Run out of cash or lose your
reputation, and the journey ends early.

16
00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:03.300
Your five advisors won't agree.

17
00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.500
Weigh their arguments, then
make the call yourself.

18
00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:13.300
Match your commitment to your capability,

19
00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:16.000
and raise it as your
market knowledge grows.

20
00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:22.400
There's no single road to going global.

21
00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:25.100
Brand Passport. Start your journey today.
